      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, D.\u00a0",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\nExpenditure from the Purse of D\u0101\u02be\u0101d: Sh\u0101fi\u02bf 1d. \u2026\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nAb\u016b Jam\u012bl to Sa\u02bf\u012bd 3 fullweighty d. He owed him for honey 3 less \u215b.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nRopes 1d.     Exchanged (to silver) 1d. less \u215b.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n(Muslim) Preacher \u00bc (d.) 5\u00bd (q.)  Preacher \u00bc (d.) 5\u00bd (q.) (i.e. total\n</li>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">11\u00bd q.)</p>\n\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nPreacher 1d. less 2\u1e25.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nMu\u1e63rim 6d. less \u215b (3q.)\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nExchange 2 less 1 q.    Total 23d. less 5 (q.) 1\u1e25.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nExpenditure from the purse of Ya\u02bfq\u016bb and M\u016bs\u0101: MRQS 16 (d.) in number, 15 in weight. 1d. returned. Received and delivered.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nPackers 5 less 5q.    Idr\u012bs 1d. less 1q.  2q.)\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u1e62af\u0101da 2d. less \u2159 (d.) 1q.   The sons of \u02bfAbd al-\u1e62amad 2 less\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nPreacher \u00bc (d.) 5q.    One quarter returned to him.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nTotal without the quarter returned 25d. less \u2153.\n</li>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nThe Purse of Ibn \u02bfAll\u0101n, the Agent: 45d. Na\u1e63r\u016bn \u00bdd.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nIdr\u012bs 2 less 2q.     TWDR 1d. less 1q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nAl-\u02bfA\u1e6d\u016bf\u012b \u00bc (d.)    TWDR to Ab\u016b \u1e24ab\u012bb 3 less \u215b (3q.)\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u02bfAl\u012b 3 less \u215b. Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b 2d. less 2q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nThe Judge 4d. less \u2159 (4q.)   Ibn Bukhtur\u012b 1d. less 1\u1e25.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nBrokers 1d. less 1q.    Exchange for Sarj\u012bs of 1d. less 1q.\n</li>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u00a0\u00a01 \u1e25.</p>\n<p></p>\n\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nTWDR 1d. less 1q.    ... was returned by Ab\u016b D\u0101\u2019\u016bd.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nBHBSHYM 1d. less 1q.   \u2018Abd al-\u1e62amad for al-B\u016b\u1e63\u012br\u012b 1 q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nExchange 1d. less 1q. For bar\u1e6dil and freight of the boat 2 less 1q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nS\u0101lim 5q.     Hiba 2d. 2q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nIdr\u012bs 3 less \u215b (3q.) less 1\u1e25.   Exchange 1d. less 2 \u1e25.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nIdr\u012bs 1d. less \u00bdq.    \u1e62af\u0101da 20q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nTo his credit 1d. less 2 \u1e25.   . .1. 1d. less 1q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nCanvas 22 less 1q.    BQY. (Buqayr?) 1d. less 1d\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nAl-B\u016b\u1e63\u012br\u012b 1d. less 1q. The sons of \u02bfAbu\u00a0 al-\u1e62amad 1d. less 1q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Total 115d. less \u00bc.\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
