      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Table 2",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Payments to Idr\u012bs (a Muslim)</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">3d. less 49. C, 5.    2d. less 2q. D, 14</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">1d. less 1/3q. C, 6    3d. less 2 \u2154q. D, 23</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">3d. less 6q. C, 13    1d. less \u00bdq. D, 24</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">1q. C, 14.     2d. less 5q. E, 27</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">1d. less 1q. D, 9    3 in number\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 E, 29</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">The average discount : 1q. per 1d, i.e. 1/24.</li></ol>\n",
